      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“来自海外的刺客！？\n打算改变日本竞赛界！\n吉兆震撼出道！”",
      "source_fingerprint": "4d3fea07c67eab44e33e2fc7cb6995fb8e9d8865a0d9d8bf0c7ecdd6ad31d40e",
