    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5129e12e8f20188cb4f8a1b6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“──她的目标居然是提升日本竞赛界的水准！\n因此她夸下海口，\n要展现自己强悍实力──”",
      "source_fingerprint": "a82d3abe233f3da18e4ef5d950fd4ca5ee5a4751d12afdea014594241526c4c7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
