    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ae5c0b2fb2482abc27445a4d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……虽然句句都属实，\n但是这篇报导比我预期的\n更为夸大了她的“革命”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "08762443a406e69fd28546d1e07a8e0d7832ad12a8af92f354e36ee1664abb2a",
