      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比赛才刚结束，为什么她能像那样──\n该说是若无其事？还是冷静呢……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "7e3a0bf5c91f4bf79057896179930fef3028cda0be53b9173a99a5bec1d4fc49",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
