      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "报导公开后，\n对于吉兆所说的“革命”，\n网络上也出现了认为这是“多管闲事”等意见──",
      "source_fingerprint": "a8dc66f54aff172256f6c1a3da8b2999394ecfb88f1f1436a9ec23ca6b525467",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
